{"articleNo":"124284","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=124284&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"신입생 도서관 이용 안내(학생증 미발급 학생)-재 공지","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.03.02","hit":"3478","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">신입생의 도서관 이용에 대해서 다시 알립니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">학부 및 대학원 신입생은 학생증 발급전이라도 본인 확인 후</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">신분증 지참</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">도서대출이 가능합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font face=\"바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* 학적파일에 본인 사진을 올린 학생은 신분증이 없어도 본인확인이 가능합니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 3</span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">월 한달간 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">열람실</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">층</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">은 좌석지정을 하지 않아도 사용할 수 있으므로 이용에 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* 도서관 이용에 문의사항이 있으면 도서관 3층 열람팀(478-7167~8)로 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>* 전화 문의가 많아 다시 공지하오니 신입생 여러분의 많은 도서관 이용을 바랍니다.</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
